		Removes all elements from the ArrayList.
		
	teamNums.clear();	// ArrayList now has no elements
	System.out.println(teamNums.size());	// Prints 0

add()
	boolean add(T newElement)
		Adds newElement to the end of the ArrayList.
		ArrayList's size is increased by one.
	void add(int index, T newElement)
		Adds newElement to the ArrayList at the specified index.
		Elements at that specified index and higher are shifted over to make room.
